  <spirit:description>BPSK modulator with AXI4-Lite control registers and 64-bit AXI4-Stream I/Q output. Inserts into the Analog Devices FMCOMM2/AD9361 DAC data path on the ZED board, replacing the DAC DMA stream to util_ad9361_dac_upack. Supports internal test patterns, register patterns, or serial bit input.</spirit:description>
